msgstr "%1 ouvrira le bureau choisi lors de la dernière connexion."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a login screen name (GDM).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/dm_autologin.rs
msgid ""
"%1 can't be told which desktop to open on automatic sign-in: it opens the "
"one chosen at the last sign-in through %1."
msgstr ""
"On ne peut pas indiquer à %1 quel bureau ouvrir lors de la connexion "
"automatique : il ouvre celui choisi lors de la dernière connexion via %1."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a login screen name. Game mode is Rexon's "like Steam Machine" mode.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/dm_autologin.rs
msgid ""
"%1 can't sign you back in by itself after you sign out, and game mode relies "
"on that."
msgstr ""
"%1 ne sait pas vous reconnecter de lui-même après une déconnexion, et le "
"mode jeu en dépend."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a login screen name, %2 a user name, %3 a system group name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/dm_autologin.rs
msgid "To let %1 sign in without a password, Rexon adds %2 to the group %3."
msgstr ""
"Pour que %1 ouvre la session sans mot de passe, Rexon ajoutera %2 au groupe "
"%3."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a login screen name, %2 a user name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/dm_autologin.rs
msgid ""
"%1 has automatic sign-in for %2 turned on. You don't sign in automatically "
"now, so Rexon turns it off there too."
msgstr ""
"La connexion automatique de %2 est activée dans %1. Vous ne vous connectez "
"pas automatiquement en ce moment, Rexon la désactivera donc là aussi."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a user name, %2 a login screen name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/dm_autologin.rs
msgid ""
"Automatic sign-in for %1 will be lost: %2 sets it as the desktop's start "
"command in its own settings, and Rexon doesn't write that. Turn it on in the "
"settings of %2 after the restart."
msgstr ""
"La connexion automatique de %1 sera perdue : %2 la définit comme commande de "
"lancement du bureau dans ses propres réglages, et Rexon ne l'écrit pas. "
"Activez-la dans les réglages de %2 après le redémarrage."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a user name, %2 a login screen name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/dm_autologin.rs
msgid ""
"Automatic sign-in for %1 will be lost: Rexon doesn't know where %2 keeps "
"this setting."
msgstr ""
"La connexion automatique de %1 sera perdue : Rexon ne sait pas où %2 garde "
"ce réglage."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a user name, %2 a login screen name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/dm_autologin.rs
msgid ""
"Automatic sign-in for %1 will be lost: %2 takes this setting from a file of "
"its package, which Rexon doesn't change."
msgstr ""
"La connexion automatique de %1 sera perdue : %2 prend ce réglage dans un "
"fichier de son paquet, que Rexon ne modifie pas."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a user name, %2 a login screen name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/dm_autologin.rs
msgid ""
"Automatic sign-in for %1 will be lost: %2 runs its own screen as this user."
msgstr ""
"La connexion automatique de %1 sera perdue : %2 affiche son propre écran "
"sous cet utilisateur."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a user name, %2 a login screen name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/dm_autologin.rs
msgid "Automatic sign-in for %1 moved to %2."
msgstr "La connexion automatique de %1 a été reportée sur %2."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a login screen name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/dm_autologin.rs
msgid ""
"Automatic sign-in wasn't moved to %1 — turn it on in the settings of %1."
msgstr ""
"La connexion automatique n'a pas pu être reportée sur %1 — activez-la dans "
"les réglages de %1."

