"ouvertes et les espaces de travail."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "Like Mageia"
msgstr "Comme Mageia"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid ""
"Two panels: menus, Mageia Control Center, terminal and Firefox at the top; "
"open windows and workspaces at the bottom."
msgstr ""
"Deux panneaux : en haut les menus, le Centre de contrôle Mageia, le terminal "
