#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "Like Unity"
msgstr "Comme Unity"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid ""
"A panel at the top with the menu and indicators; apps are launched from a "
"dock on the left."
msgstr ""
"Un panneau en haut avec le menu et les indicateurs ; les applications se "
"lancent depuis un dock à gauche."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "Netbook"
msgstr "Netbook"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid ""
