#. TRANSLATORS: help page in HTML. Keep the tags, the file names, the
#. JSON keys and the type names (theme-gtk, plugin…) as they are;
#. translate the prose and the sample values of "name", "author" and
#. "description". The <pre> blocks stay left-to-right in every language,
#. so keep their arrows ← as they are.
#. No leading line break: xgettext strips it from the msgid, and the
#. string in the code would diverge from the catalog key.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/qt_extensions.rs
msgid ""
"<p>A Rexon extension is a plain <b>ZIP archive</b> with the <code>.rxn</"
"code> extension.\n"
"Every type has the same layout:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>\n"
"extension.rxn (ZIP):\n"
"├── manifest.json     ← REQUIRED (format_version: 3)\n"
"├── preview.png       ← 620×348 (for the catalog and cards)\n"
"├── icon.png          ← 128×128 (lists in Rexon)\n"
"├── install.sh        ← for desktop-tool / plugin\n"
"├── uninstall.sh      ← for desktop-tool / plugin\n"
"├── app.desktop       ← for desktop-tool\n"
"├── README.md         ← optional, the description\n"
"└── data/             ← the extension's files\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>📋 Minimal manifest.json</h3>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"{\n"
"  \"format_version\": 3,\n"
"  \"id\": \"my-cool-theme\",\n"
"  \"name\": \"My Cool Theme\",\n"
"  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n"
"  \"author\": \"Me\",\n"
"  \"description\": \"What the extension does\",\n"
"  \"type\": \"theme-gtk\",\n"
"  \"tags\": [\"dark\", \"modern\"],\n"
"  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n"
"  \"homepage\": \"https://github.com/me/my-theme\",\n"
"  \"de_support\": [\"any\"]\n"
"}\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>🎨 Categories (the <code>type</code> field)</h3>\n"
"<p><b>Appearance</b> — Rexon installs the files automatically:<br>\n"
"<code>theme-gtk, theme-icons, theme-cursors, theme-sounds,\n"
"theme-kde-global, theme-kde-colors, theme-kde-plasma, theme-kvantum,\n"
"theme-window-decoration, theme-login-screen, theme-plymouth, theme-conky,\n"
"theme-bundle, theme-plasmoid, wallpaper-pack, font-pack</code></p>\n"
"\n"
"<p><b>Desktop customization</b> — Rexon puts it into that desktop's own\n"
"folder and turns it on with the desktop's own tools:<br>\n"
"<code>kde-kwin-script, kde-kwin-effect, kde-window-switcher,\n"
"kde-wallpaper-plugin, theme-kde-splash, theme-kde-lockscreen,\n"
"gnome-shell-extension, theme-gnome-shell, cinnamon-applet, cinnamon-"
"desklet,\n"
"cinnamon-extension, theme-cinnamon, nemo-action, theme-xfwm4, theme-marco,\n"
"theme-lxqt</code></p>\n"
"\n"
"<p><b>Extensions</b> (you get a warning on install — they run code):<br>\n"
"<code>desktop-tool</code>, <code>plugin</code></p>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>📦 Packing</h3>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"cd my-extension/\n"
"zip -r ../my-extension.rxn .\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Drag the finished <code>.rxn</code> into the Rexon window or click\n"
"<b>「📦 From File」</b>.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>🔗 Full documentation</h3>\n"
"<p>In the Rexon sources: <code>extensions/constants.py</code> has the full "
"list\n"
"of types and install paths.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Une extension Rexon est une simple <b>archive ZIP</b> portant l'extension "
"<code>.rxn</code>.\n"
"Tous les types ont la même structure :</p>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>\n"
"extension.rxn (ZIP):\n"
"├── manifest.json     ← OBLIGATOIRE (format_version: 3)\n"
"├── preview.png       ← 620×348 (pour le catalogue et les fiches)\n"
"├── icon.png          ← 128×128 (listes dans Rexon)\n"
"├── install.sh        ← pour desktop-tool / plugin\n"
"├── uninstall.sh      ← pour desktop-tool / plugin\n"
"├── app.desktop       ← pour desktop-tool\n"
"├── README.md         ← facultatif, la description\n"
"└── data/             ← les fichiers de l'extension\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>📋 manifest.json minimal</h3>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"{\n"
"  \"format_version\": 3,\n"
"  \"id\": \"my-cool-theme\",\n"
"  \"name\": \"Mon super thème\",\n"
"  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n"
"  \"author\": \"Moi\",\n"
"  \"description\": \"Ce que fait l'extension\",\n"
"  \"type\": \"theme-gtk\",\n"
"  \"tags\": [\"dark\", \"modern\"],\n"
"  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n"
"  \"homepage\": \"https://github.com/me/my-theme\",\n"
"  \"de_support\": [\"any\"]\n"
"}\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>🎨 Catégories (le champ <code>type</code>)</h3>\n"
"<p><b>Apparence</b> — Rexon installe les fichiers automatiquement :<br>\n"
"<code>theme-gtk, theme-icons, theme-cursors, theme-sounds,\n"
"theme-kde-global, theme-kde-colors, theme-kde-plasma, theme-kvantum,\n"
"theme-window-decoration, theme-login-screen, theme-plymouth, theme-conky,\n"
"theme-bundle, theme-plasmoid, wallpaper-pack, font-pack</code></p>\n"
"\n"
"<p><b>Personnalisation des environnements de bureau</b> — Rexon la place "
"dans le dossier\n"
"de ce bureau et l'active avec ses propres outils :<br>\n"
"<code>kde-kwin-script, kde-kwin-effect, kde-window-switcher,\n"
"kde-wallpaper-plugin, theme-kde-splash, theme-kde-lockscreen,\n"
"gnome-shell-extension, theme-gnome-shell, cinnamon-applet, cinnamon-"
"desklet,\n"
"cinnamon-extension, theme-cinnamon, nemo-action, theme-xfwm4, theme-marco,\n"
"theme-lxqt</code></p>\n"
"\n"
"<p><b>Extensions</b> (un avertissement s'affiche à l'installation : elles "
"exécutent du code) :<br>\n"
"<code>desktop-tool</code>, <code>plugin</code></p>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>📦 Empaquetage</h3>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"cd my-extension/\n"
"zip -r ../my-extension.rxn .\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Glissez le fichier <code>.rxn</code> terminé dans la fenêtre de Rexon ou "
"cliquez sur\n"
"<b>« 📦 Depuis un fichier »</b>.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>🔗 Documentation complète</h3>\n"
"<p>Dans les sources de Rexon : <code>extensions/constants.py</code> contient "
"la liste complète\n"
"des types et des chemins d'installation.</p>\n"

