"lock by itself when you step away."
msgstr ""
"L'économiseur d'écran de ce bureau (%1) n'est pas lancé : quand vous vous "
"absentez, l'écran ne se verrouille pas tout seul."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a screen saver product name, e.g. "XScreenSaver".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screensaver_guard.rs
msgid ""
"A screen saver from another desktop (%1) is running in this session. It can "
"replace or switch off the desktop's own screen lock."
msgstr ""
"Un économiseur d'écran d'un autre bureau (%1) tourne dans cette session. Il "
"peut remplacer ou désactiver le verrouillage d'écran propre au bureau."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a screen saver product name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screensaver_guard.rs
msgid "Rexon will close %1 in this session only — nothing is uninstalled."
msgstr ""
"Rexon fermera %1 dans cette session seulement — rien n'est désinstallé."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a screen saver product name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screensaver_guard.rs
msgid "Rexon will start %1 again."
msgstr "Rexon relancera %1."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screensaver_guard.rs
msgid "Your screen saver settings are not changed."
msgstr "Vos réglages d'économiseur d'écran ne changent pas."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screensaver_guard.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon found a problem with the screen saver and will offer to fix it when "
"you close this window."
msgstr ""
"Rexon a trouvé un problème avec l'économiseur d'écran et proposera de le "
"corriger quand vous fermerez cette fenêtre."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screensaver_guard.rs
msgid ""
"The other screen saver has been closed. The desktop's own screen lock works "
"as before."
msgstr ""
"L'économiseur d'écran étranger a été fermé. Le verrouillage d'écran propre "
"au bureau fonctionne comme avant."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a screen saver product name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screensaver_guard.rs
msgid ""
"Could not start %1. Log out and log in again — the desktop starts it by "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de lancer %1. Fermez la session et reconnectez-vous — le bureau "
"le lance de lui-même."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a screen saver product name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screensaver_guard.rs
msgid "%1 is running again: the screen will lock by itself as before."
msgstr ""
"%1 fonctionne de nouveau : l'écran se verrouillera tout seul comme avant."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screenshots.rs
msgid "YOUR DESKTOP"
msgstr "VOTRE BUREAU"

#. TRANSLATORS: the unrecognized desktop inside a sentence, after a
#. preposition: “Restored 2 apps for your desktop”.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screenshots.rs
msgctxt "unknown desktop in a sentence"
msgid "your desktop"
msgstr "votre bureau"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screenshots.rs
msgid "Loading screenshot…"
msgstr "Chargement de la capture d'écran…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screenshots.rs
msgid "The screenshot will appear once you're online"
msgstr "La capture d'écran apparaîtra dès que vous serez connecté à Internet"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screenshots.rs
msgid "No screenshot of this desktop yet"
msgstr "Pas encore de capture d'écran de ce bureau"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screenshots.rs
msgid ""
"No screenshot program found (grim, spectacle, gnome-screenshot, scrot, maim)"
msgstr ""
"Aucun programme de capture d'écran trouvé (grim, spectacle, gnome-"
"screenshot, scrot, maim)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screenshots.rs
msgid "Too many requests (429)"
msgstr "Trop de requêtes (429)"

#. TRANSLATORS: download check failed; %1 is the content type the server sent.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screenshots.rs
msgid "Not an image: %1"
msgstr "Ce n'est pas une image : %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screenshots.rs
msgid "The file is too small"
msgstr "Le fichier est trop petit"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screenshots.rs
msgid "Couldn't download the screenshot: %1"
msgstr "Impossible de télécharger la capture d'écran : %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screenshots.rs
msgid "Write error: %1"
msgstr "Erreur d'écriture : %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid "AeroThemePlasma Is Turned Off for Now"
msgstr "AeroThemePlasma est désactivé pour le moment"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid ""
"Plasma failed to start with AeroThemePlasma (%1), so Rexon switched to the "
"standard Plasma look for now. Your settings are saved and come back after a "
"rebuild."
msgstr ""
"Plasma n'a pas démarré avec AeroThemePlasma (%1), Rexon a donc activé "
"l'apparence standard de Plasma pour le moment. Vos réglages sont conservés "
"et reviendront après la recompilation."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid ""
"Plasma was updated, and AeroThemePlasma no longer fits it. To keep the "
"desktop working, Rexon switched to the standard Plasma look for now. Your "
"settings are saved and come back after a rebuild."
msgstr ""
"Plasma a été mis à jour, et AeroThemePlasma ne lui convient plus. Pour que "
"le bureau continue de fonctionner, Rexon a activé l'apparence standard de "
"Plasma pour le moment. Vos réglages sont conservés et reviendront après la "
"recompilation."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid "The AeroThemePlasma effects are turned off in KWin."
msgstr "Les effets AeroThemePlasma sont désactivés dans KWin."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid ""
"The panels are replaced with the standard Plasma panel; your layout is saved."
msgstr ""
"Les panneaux ont été remplacés par le panneau standard de Plasma ; leur "
"disposition est conservée."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid "To bring everything back without rebuilding: rexon %1"
msgstr "Pour tout rétablir sans recompiler : rexon %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid "AeroThemePlasma Turns Off at Next Login"
msgstr "AeroThemePlasma sera désactivé à la prochaine connexion"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 says which AeroThemePlasma module crashed.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid ""
"The Plasma desktop crashed because of AeroThemePlasma (%1). From the next "
"login, Rexon uses the standard Plasma panels until AeroThemePlasma is "
"rebuilt. Your layout is saved and comes back after a rebuild."
msgstr ""
"Le bureau Plasma a planté à cause d'AeroThemePlasma (%1). À partir de la "
"prochaine connexion, Rexon utilisera les panneaux standard de Plasma jusqu'à "
"la recompilation d'AeroThemePlasma. La disposition de vos panneaux est "
"conservée et reviendra après la recompilation."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid "AeroThemePlasma Is Back"
msgstr "AeroThemePlasma est de retour"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid ""
"AeroThemePlasma fits Plasma again, so Rexon brought back your saved look and "
"panels."
msgstr ""
"AeroThemePlasma convient de nouveau à Plasma, Rexon a donc rétabli votre "
"apparence et vos panneaux enregistrés."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid "Rebuild"
msgstr "Recompiler"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid ""
"Your AeroThemePlasma effects are back on. The panels come back at the next "
"login."
msgstr ""
"Les effets AeroThemePlasma sont réactivés. Les panneaux reviendront à la "
"prochaine connexion."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid "Your AeroThemePlasma effects are back on."
msgstr "Les effets AeroThemePlasma sont réactivés."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid "Nothing to restore: Rexon hasn't changed your Plasma look."
msgstr "Rien à rétablir : Rexon n'a pas modifié l'apparence de votre Plasma."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid "Restored the saved Plasma look."
msgstr "L'apparence enregistrée de Plasma a été rétablie."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid "Left as you changed them: %1"
msgstr "Laissé tel que vous l'avez réglé vous-même : %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid "The panels come back at the next login."
msgstr "Les panneaux reviendront à la prochaine connexion."

#. TRANSLATORS: name of Steam's standard built-in startup movie.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Steam Deck (Default)"
msgstr "Steam Deck (par défaut)"

#. TRANSLATORS: name of a built-in Steam startup movie: the one Steam plays on a freshly installed (factory) Steam Deck system image.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Steam Deck (Factory Image)"
msgstr "Steam Deck (image d'usine)"

#. TRANSLATORS: startup movie from the Steam inventory whose name is unknown; %1 is its item id.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Inventory · %1"
msgstr "Inventaire · %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: where a startup movie comes from: the user's own movie in Steam's folder for custom startup movies (Steam shows it too).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Your own movie"
msgstr "Votre propre vidéo"

#. TRANSLATORS: where a startup movie comes from: built into the Steam client.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Built into Steam"
msgstr "Intégrée à Steam"

#. TRANSLATORS: where a startup movie comes from: a video file the user picked.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Your own file"
msgstr "Votre propre fichier"

#. TRANSLATORS: a startup movie the user picked can't be used: ffprobe couldn't read it.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Couldn't read this file — it may be damaged or not a video."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de lire le fichier — il est peut-être endommagé, ou ce n'est pas "
"une vidéo."

#. TRANSLATORS: a startup movie the user picked can't be used: the file has no video picture (e.g. it is music).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "This file has no picture — choose a video file."
msgstr "Ce fichier ne contient pas d'image — choisissez un fichier vidéo."

#. TRANSLATORS: a startup movie the user picked can't be used: it is shorter than one second.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"The video is shorter than a second — it would flash by unnoticed. Choose a "
"longer one."
msgstr ""
"La vidéo dure moins d'une seconde — elle passerait inaperçue. Choisissez-en "
"une plus longue."

#. TRANSLATORS: a startup movie the user picked can't be used: it is longer than one minute.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"The video is longer than a minute — a startup movie should be short. Trim it "
"or choose another one."
msgstr ""
"La vidéo dure plus d'une minute — une vidéo de démarrage doit être courte. "
"Raccourcissez-la ou choisissez-en une autre."

#. TRANSLATORS: a startup movie the user picked can't be used: its picture is too small; %1 and %2 are its width and height in pixels.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"The picture is too small (%1×%2) — it would look blurry on screen. Choose a "
"video of at least 640×360."
msgstr ""
"L'image est trop petite (%1×%2) — elle serait floue à l'écran. Choisissez "
"une vidéo d'au moins 640×360."

#. TRANSLATORS: warning when adding a startup movie longer than 30 seconds; it is still accepted.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"The video is longer than 30 seconds — it's a startup movie, not a film: "
"you'll wait for it at every login."
msgstr ""
"La vidéo dure plus de 30 secondes — c'est une vidéo de démarrage, pas un "
"film : il faudra l'attendre à chaque connexion."

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when adding a startup movie that Steam can't play as is; the original file stays untouched.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"The video will be converted to WebM so Steam can play it. The original file "
"stays as it is."
msgstr ""
"La vidéo sera convertie en WebM pour que Steam puisse la lire. Le fichier "
"d'origine reste tel quel."

#. TRANSLATORS: progress while adding a startup movie: the video tools (ffmpeg) are being installed.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "⏳ Installing the video tools (ffmpeg)…"
msgstr "⏳ Installation des outils vidéo (ffmpeg)…"

#. TRANSLATORS: progress while adding a startup movie: the chosen file is being checked.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "⏳ Checking the video…"
msgstr "⏳ Vérification de la vidéo…"

#. TRANSLATORS: progress while adding a startup movie: the file is being copied.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "⏳ Copying the video…"
msgstr "⏳ Copie de la vidéo…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "⏳ Converting the video for Steam…"
msgstr "⏳ Conversion de la vidéo pour Steam…"

#. TRANSLATORS: progress while converting a startup movie; %1 is the percentage done.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "⏳ Converting the video for Steam… %1%"
msgstr "⏳ Conversion de la vidéo pour Steam… %1 %"

#. TRANSLATORS: a startup movie was added; %1 is its name. Steam lists it too.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"✅ Added “%1” — it's chosen for login and also appears in Steam (the "
"Customization section)."
msgstr ""
"✅ « %1 » ajoutée — elle est choisie pour la connexion et apparaît aussi "
"dans Steam (section « Personnalisation »)."

#. TRANSLATORS: a startup movie was added (Steam isn't installed); %1 is its name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "✅ Added “%1” — it's chosen for login."
msgstr "✅ « %1 » ajoutée — elle est choisie pour la connexion."

#. TRANSLATORS: adding a startup movie was cancelled by the user.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Adding the video was cancelled."
msgstr "L'ajout de la vidéo a été annulé."

#. TRANSLATORS: a startup movie couldn't be added; %1 is the system's reason.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Couldn't add the video: %1"
msgstr "Impossible d'ajouter la vidéo : %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: adding a startup movie needs ffmpeg, and installing it failed; %1 is the reason.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"Adding a video needs the video tools (ffmpeg), and they couldn't be "
"installed: %1"
msgstr ""
"L'ajout d'une vidéo nécessite les outils vidéo (ffmpeg), et ils n'ont pas pu "
"être installés : %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: the startup movie chosen earlier was copied into Rexon's folder so it keeps working if the original is moved; %1 is its name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"The startup movie “%1” is now kept as a copy — it keeps working even if the "
"original file is moved or deleted."
msgstr ""
"La vidéo de démarrage « %1 » est désormais conservée en copie — elle "
"continue de fonctionner même si le fichier d'origine est déplacé ou supprimé."

#. TRANSLATORS: confirmation before deleting the user's own startup movie; %1 is its name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"Delete the startup movie “%1”? The copy is removed from disk; the original "
"video you added it from is not touched."
msgstr ""
"Supprimer la vidéo de démarrage « %1 » ? La copie est effacée du disque ; la "
"vidéo d'origine à partir de laquelle vous l'avez ajoutée n'est pas touchée."

#. TRANSLATORS: extra warning in the delete confirmation: Steam currently uses this movie.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"⚠️ Steam currently plays this movie at startup — after deleting, Steam goes "
"back to its standard one."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ Steam lit actuellement cette vidéo au démarrage — après la suppression, "
"Steam reviendra à sa vidéo standard."

#. TRANSLATORS: the user's own startup movie was deleted; %1 is its name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "🗑 Deleted “%1”."
msgstr "🗑 « %1 » supprimée."

#. TRANSLATORS: refusal to delete a startup movie that is built into Steam or bought in the Points Shop.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"Only your own movies can be deleted — the ones built into Steam and bought "
"in the Points Shop stay."
msgstr ""
"Seules vos propres vidéos peuvent être supprimées — celles intégrées à Steam "
"et achetées dans la boutique de points restent."

#. TRANSLATORS: Description of Rexon's splash theme in KDE System Settings (Splash Screen). KSplash and mpv are program names.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon startup movie poster (Steam style) — seamless handover from the KDE "
"splash screen to the movie"
msgstr ""
"Affiche de la vidéo de démarrage Rexon (style Steam) — transition fluide de "
"l'écran de démarrage KDE vers la vidéo"

#. TRANSLATORS: Description of the startup movie autostart entry (shown in the desktop's autostart settings).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Startup movie at login (Steam style)"
msgstr "Vidéo de démarrage à la connexion (style Steam)"

#. TRANSLATORS: dialog title: the KDE splash screen and the Rexon startup movie compete for one slot.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "One Splash Screen at a Time"
msgstr "Un seul écran de démarrage possible"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"The “%1” global theme comes with its own KDE splash screen — the screen "
"shown while you log in. There is only one slot for it, and right now it is "
"taken by the Rexon startup movie: the video that plays right after you log "
"in. The two can't work together.\n"
"\n"
"“Yes” — apply the whole global theme, splash screen included. The Rexon "
"startup movie will be turned off and the video will no longer play at "
"login.\n"
"\n"
"“No” — apply the global theme but leave the splash screen alone: the video "
"stays."
msgstr ""
"Le thème global « %1 » est fourni avec son propre écran de démarrage KDE — "
"l'écran affiché pendant la connexion. Il n'y a qu'un seul emplacement pour "
"lui, et il est actuellement occupé par la vidéo de démarrage Rexon : la "
"vidéo qui se lance juste après la connexion. Les deux ne peuvent pas "
"fonctionner ensemble.\n"
"\n"
"« Oui » — appliquer tout le thème global, écran de démarrage compris. La "
"vidéo de démarrage Rexon sera désactivée et ne sera plus lue à la "
"connexion.\n"
"\n"
"« Non » — appliquer le thème global sans toucher à l'écran de démarrage : la "
"vidéo reste."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"Right now the Rexon startup movie plays when you log in — the video that "
"plays right after you log in. It works through the KDE splash screen slot, "
"so turning the splash screen off turns the movie off too.\n"
"\n"
"“Yes” — turn off the splash screen and the Rexon startup movie.\n"
"\n"
"“No” — keep the Rexon startup movie."
msgstr ""
"Actuellement, la vidéo de démarrage Rexon est lue à la connexion — la vidéo "
"qui se lance juste après la connexion. Elle utilise l'emplacement de l'écran "
"de démarrage KDE : désactiver l'écran de démarrage désactive donc aussi la "
"vidéo.\n"
"\n"
"« Oui » — désactiver l'écran de démarrage et la vidéo de démarrage Rexon.\n"
"\n"
"« Non » — garder la vidéo de démarrage Rexon."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"The splash screen wasn't turned off — the Rexon startup movie stays at login."
msgstr ""
"L'écran de démarrage n'a pas été désactivé — la vidéo de démarrage Rexon "
"reste à la connexion."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"The KDE splash screen and the Rexon startup movie share one slot: only one "
"of them is shown when you log in.\n"
"\n"
"Right now the slot is taken by the Rexon startup movie — the video that "
"plays right after you log in.\n"
"\n"
"“Yes” — apply the “%1” splash screen. The Rexon startup movie will be turned "
"off and the video will no longer play at login.\n"
"\n"
"“No” — keep the Rexon startup movie and don't apply the “%1” splash screen."
msgstr ""
"L'écran de démarrage KDE et la vidéo de démarrage Rexon partagent un seul "
"emplacement : un seul des deux est affiché à la connexion.\n"
"\n"
"Actuellement, l'emplacement est occupé par la vidéo de démarrage Rexon — la "
"vidéo qui se lance juste après la connexion.\n"
"\n"
"« Oui » — appliquer l'écran de démarrage « %1 ». La vidéo de démarrage Rexon "
"sera désactivée et ne sera plus lue à la connexion.\n"
"\n"
"« Non » — garder la vidéo de démarrage Rexon et ne pas appliquer l'écran de "
"démarrage « %1 »."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"The splash screen was left alone — the Rexon startup movie still plays at "
"login."
msgstr ""
"L'écran de démarrage n'a pas été modifié — la vidéo de démarrage Rexon est "
"toujours lue à la connexion."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"The “%1” splash screen wasn't applied — the Rexon startup movie stays at "
"login."
msgstr ""
"L'écran de démarrage « %1 » n'a pas été appliqué — la vidéo de démarrage "
"Rexon reste à la connexion."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"The Rexon startup movie is off — the chosen splash screen now shows at login."
msgstr ""
"La vidéo de démarrage Rexon est désactivée — l'écran de démarrage choisi "
"s'affiche désormais à la connexion."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid ""
"Couldn't turn off the Rexon startup movie: %1. The chosen splash screen "
"wasn't applied — otherwise Rexon would bring its own back at the next login."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de désactiver la vidéo de démarrage Rexon : %1. L'écran de "
"démarrage choisi n'a pas été appliqué — sinon Rexon aurait rétabli le sien à "
"la prochaine connexion."

#. TRANSLATORS: name of a KDE window rule that keeps Rexon's startup movie
#. above the panel; people see it in System Settings → Window Rules.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Rexon: startup movie on top of everything"
msgstr "Rexon : vidéo de démarrage au premier plan"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "The startup movie file isn't set or can't be found"
msgstr ""
"Le fichier de la vidéo de démarrage n'est pas défini ou est introuvable"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "mpv isn't installed (it's needed for playback)"
msgstr "mpv n'est pas installé (il est nécessaire à la lecture)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "The startup movie is already playing (second launch skipped)"
msgstr ""
"La vidéo de démarrage est déjà en cours de lecture (second lancement ignoré)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Played"
msgstr "Lue"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Started"
msgstr "Lancée"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "mpv didn't finish within 120 s — stopped"
msgstr "mpv ne s'est pas terminé en 120 s — arrêté"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "The startup movie didn't finish within 120 s — stopped"
msgstr "La vidéo de démarrage ne s'est pas terminée en 120 s — arrêtée"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Choose a startup movie first"
msgstr "Choisissez d'abord une vidéo de démarrage"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Startup movie at login is on"
msgstr "Vidéo de démarrage à la connexion activée"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Startup movie at login is off"
msgstr "Vidéo de démarrage à la connexion désactivée"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Turned on (KSplash hybrid — no desktop flash)"
msgstr "Activé (hybride KSplash — sans apparition furtive du bureau)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "KSplash hybrid is on"
msgstr "Hybride KSplash activé"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "KSplash hybrid is off"
msgstr "Hybride KSplash désactivé"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "KSplash theme updated"
