msgstr "Installation terminée"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a configuration.nix snippet.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"NixOS uses a declarative model.\n"
"Add this to /etc/nixos/configuration.nix:\n"
"\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Then run:\n"
"  sudo nixos-rebuild switch"
msgstr ""
"NixOS utilise un modèle déclaratif.\n"
"Ajoutez ceci à /etc/nixos/configuration.nix :\n"
"\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Puis exécutez :\n"
"  sudo nixos-rebuild switch"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon can't set up the '%1' desktop on NixOS.\n"
"Set it up yourself in /etc/nixos/configuration.nix."
msgstr ""
"Le bureau '%1' n'est pas pris en charge sur NixOS par Rexon.\n"
"Configurez-le manuellement dans /etc/nixos/configuration.nix."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "🔓 Turning off steamos-readonly…"
msgstr "🔓 Désactivation de steamos-readonly…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "🔑 Setting up the pacman keys…"
msgstr "🔑 Initialisation des clés pacman…"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a number of packages.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "📦 Installing packages: %1…"
msgstr "📦 Installation des paquets : %1…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "🔒 Turning steamos-readonly back on…"
msgstr "🔒 Réactivation de steamos-readonly…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Installation on SteamOS complete"
msgstr "Installation sur SteamOS terminée"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the distribution name, %2 package names.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"%1 is an immutable distribution.\n"
"The regular dnf doesn't work here. Use:\n"
"\n"
"  rpm-ostree install %2\n"
"  systemctl reboot\n"
"\n"
"Or install the desktop with Fedora Toolbox / Distrobox."
msgstr ""
"%1 est une distribution immuable.\n"
"Le dnf habituel ne fonctionne pas ici. Utilisez :\n"
"\n"
"  rpm-ostree install %2\n"
"  systemctl reboot\n"
"\n"
"Ou installez le bureau avec Fedora Toolbox / Distrobox."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Bazzite is an immutable (ostree) distribution.\n"
"To install packages:\n"
"\n"
"  rpm-ostree install %1\n"
"  systemctl reboot\n"
"\n"
"Or use Distrobox for an isolated environment."
msgstr ""
"Bazzite est une distribution immuable (ostree).\n"
"Pour installer des paquets :\n"
"\n"
"  rpm-ostree install %1\n"
"  systemctl reboot\n"
"\n"
"Ou utilisez Distrobox pour un environnement isolé."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"%1 is an immutable distribution.\n"
"Installing packages with the regular package manager may not work.\n"
"Use Flatpak, Distrobox or your distribution's own tools."
msgstr ""
"%1 est une distribution immuable.\n"
"L'installation de paquets avec le gestionnaire de paquets habituel risque de "
"ne pas fonctionner.\n"
"Utilisez Flatpak, Distrobox ou les outils propres à votre distribution."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"You can't remove your current desktop (%1): after you log out there would be "
"nothing to log in to. Switch to another installed desktop first."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de supprimer le bureau actuel (%1) : après la déconnexion, il n'y "
"aurait plus rien où se connecter. Passez d'abord à un autre bureau installé."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "No packages for this distribution"
msgstr "Aucun paquet pour cette distribution"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Couldn't detect your current desktop"
msgstr "Impossible de déterminer le bureau actuel"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Already in use: %1"
msgstr "Déjà utilisé : %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Rexon does not remove %1: the system needs it to work"
msgstr "Rexon ne supprime pas %1 : le système ne fonctionne pas sans lui"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Invalid package name: %1. A package name is expected, not a file path."
msgstr ""
"Nom de paquet non valide : %1. Un nom de paquet est attendu, pas un chemin "
"de fichier."

#. TRANSLATORS: Name of the system action in the password dialog (polkit).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Install or repair a desktop environment"
msgstr "Installer ou réparer un environnement de bureau"

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of the system password dialog (polkit).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Authentication is required to install a desktop environment"
msgstr ""
"Une authentification est nécessaire pour installer un environnement de bureau"

#. TRANSLATORS: Name of the system action in the password dialog (polkit).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Install, remove or update packages"
msgstr "Installer, supprimer ou mettre à jour des paquets"

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of the system password dialog (polkit).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Authentication is required to manage packages"
msgstr "Une authentification est nécessaire pour gérer les paquets"

#. TRANSLATORS: Name of the system action in the password dialog (polkit): login screen background, greeter theme or MATE panel layout.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Install a system login-screen or panel layout"
msgstr "Installer un écran de connexion ou une disposition de panneau"

#. TRANSLATORS: Name of the system action in the password dialog (polkit): one password lets Rexon make system changes until its window is closed.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Allow Rexon system changes while its window is open"
msgstr "Autoriser Rexon à modifier le système tant que sa fenêtre est ouverte"

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of the system password dialog (polkit): one password for all system changes until the Rexon window is closed.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Authentication is required to let Rexon make system changes until its window "
"is closed"
msgstr ""
"Une authentification est nécessaire pour que Rexon puisse modifier le "
"système tant que sa fenêtre est ouverte"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "the Deepin window manager"
msgstr "le gestionnaire de fenêtres de Deepin"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ You have %1 installed — the new River branch, which has no built-in "
"tiling. Rexon installs the classic River branch (river-classic) with its own "
"tiling, and for that %1 has to be replaced."
msgstr ""
"⛔ %1 est installé — la nouvelle branche de River, sans mosaïque intégrée. "
"Rexon installe la branche classique de River (river-classic) avec sa propre "
"mosaïque, et pour cela %1 doit être remplacé."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Your ~/.config/river/init stays as it is. If it was written for %1, the "
"classic River will run it too; if River then starts without keys, rename "
"that file, and “Check / Repair” will put the Rexon starter one in its place."
msgstr ""
"Votre ~/.config/river/init reste tel quel. S'il a été écrit pour %1, le "
"River classique le lancera aussi ; si River démarre ensuite sans raccourcis "
"clavier, renommez ce fichier — « Vérifier / Réparer » mettra à sa place le "
"fichier de démarrage de Rexon."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the installed program being replaced (e.g. “River 0.5”).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "🔁 Replace %1"
msgstr "🔁 Remplacer %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the installed program (e.g. “River 0.5”), %2 the
#. package installed in its place.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon will ask first. %1 is removed and %2 installed in the same pacman "
"transaction: if the installation doesn't go through, %1 stays."
msgstr ""
"Rexon vous demandera d'abord. %1 est retiré et %2 installé dans une même "
"transaction pacman : si l'installation échoue, %1 reste en place."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the installed program being replaced (e.g. “River 0.5”).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Replace %1"
msgstr "Remplacer %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the installed program (e.g. “River 0.5”), %2 its
#. package, %3 the package installed in its place, %4 the desktop.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"%1 (package %2) will be removed, and %3 will be installed in its place; then "
"%4 is set up as usual. It all happens in one pacman transaction: if it "
"doesn't go through, %1 stays installed.\n"
"\n"
"Replace it?"
msgstr ""
"%1 (paquet %2) sera supprimé et %3 sera installé à sa place ; ensuite %4 "
"sera configuré comme d'habitude. Tout se fait dans une seule transaction "
"pacman : si elle échoue, %1 reste installé.\n"
"\n"
"Le remplacer ?"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Rexon can replace a conflicting package only with pacman."
msgstr "Rexon ne sait remplacer un paquet en conflit qu'avec pacman."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 and %2 are two packages of the set being installed.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ Installation won't work: the set needs both %1 and %2, and the two can't "
"be installed at once."
msgstr ""
"⛔ L'installation ne passera pas : l'ensemble a besoin à la fois de %1 et de "
"%2, et les deux ne peuvent pas être installés en même temps."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the desktop being installed, %2 the installed
#. desktop, %3 a program both need (e.g. mutter), %4 the version %1
#. needs, %5 the package of that version, %6 the version %2 needs.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ %1 can't be installed next to %2: %1 needs %3 %4 (%5), and %2 needs %3 "
"%6; the two can't be installed at once. To install %1, you'd have to remove "
"%2 — Rexon doesn't remove another desktop by itself."
msgstr ""
"⛔ %1 ne peut pas être installé à côté de %2 : %1 a besoin de %3 %4 (%5), et "
"%2 de %3 %6 ; les deux ne peuvent pas être installés en même temps. Pour "
"installer %1, il faudrait supprimer %2 — Rexon ne supprime pas lui-même un "
"autre bureau."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the desktop being installed, %2 the installed
#. desktop, %3 the package of %1 (role and name), %4 the package of %2.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ %1 can't be installed next to %2: %3 conflicts with %4. To install %1, "
"you'd have to remove %2 — Rexon doesn't remove another desktop by itself."
msgstr ""
"⛔ %1 ne peut pas être installé à côté de %2 : %3 est en conflit avec %4. "
"Pour installer %1, il faudrait supprimer %2 — Rexon ne supprime pas lui-même "
"un autre bureau."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the package being installed, %2 an installed
#. package, %3 the installed packages that need %2 (comma-separated).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ Installation won't work: %1 conflicts with the installed package %2 "
"(needed by %3). pacman would have to remove %2 along with them, and Rexon "
"doesn't do that by itself."
msgstr ""
"⛔ L'installation échouera : %1 est en conflit avec le paquet installé %2 "
"(requis par : %3). pacman devrait supprimer %2 avec eux, et Rexon ne le fait "
"pas lui-même."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the package being installed, %2 an installed package.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ Installation won't work: %1 conflicts with the installed package %2. "
"pacman would have to remove %2, and Rexon doesn't do that by itself."
msgstr ""
"⛔ L'installation échouera : %1 est en conflit avec le paquet installé %2. "
"pacman devrait supprimer %2, et Rexon ne le fait pas lui-même."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop (e.g. Pantheon). The phrase is %1 of
#. “Not installing %1: …” and its sister lines — write it in the case
#. and capitalization that fits the start of those lines in your
#. language (Russian: “Экран входа %1”).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "the %1 login screen"
msgstr "L'écran de connexion de %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is what is not installed (e.g. “the Pantheon
#. login screen”), %2 a program (e.g. Mutter), %3 the version %1
#. needs, %4 the installed desktops, %5 the version they need.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⚠️ Not installing %1: it needs %2 %3, and %4 needs %2 %5 — the two can't be "
"installed at once."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ %1 n'est pas installé : il a besoin de %2 %3, alors que %4 a besoin de %2 "
"%5 ; les deux ne peuvent pas être installés en même temps."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is what is not installed, %2 a package the rest
#. of the set needs.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⚠️ Not installing %1: it conflicts with %2, which the rest of the set needs."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ %1 n'est pas installé : il est en conflit avec %2, dont le reste de "
"l'ensemble a besoin."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is what is not installed, %2 an installed package.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "⚠️ Not installing %1: it conflicts with the installed package %2."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ %1 n'est pas installé : il est en conflit avec le paquet installé %2."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the desktop being installed.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"You can sign in to %1 from the regular login screen; everything else will be "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez ouvrir une session %1 depuis l'écran de connexion habituel ; "
"tout le reste sera installé."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Everything else will be installed without it."
msgstr "Tout le reste sera installé sans lui."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⏳ Waiting for the package manager to become free (another transaction is "
"still running its hooks)…"
msgstr ""
"⏳ En attente de la libération du gestionnaire de paquets (une autre "
"opération sur les paquets n'a pas encore terminé ses dernières étapes)…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"The rollback didn't start: no stock package was found to replace the fork."
msgstr ""
"Annulation non lancée : aucun paquet KDE standard n'a été trouvé pour "
"remplacer le fork."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "(the fork didn't name any package)"
msgstr "(le fork n'a indiqué aucun nom)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "%1 — not in the repositories: %2"
msgstr "%1 — absent des dépôts : %2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Usually this means KDE renamed the stock package, while the fork build still "
"uses the old name.\n"
"Nothing was removed — your system is untouched.\n"
"\n"
"What to do: refresh the package database (System Update) and try again. If "
"the name still can't be found, the fork needs a fresh rebuild — it will "
"bring the correct stock name."
msgstr ""
"En général, cela signifie que KDE a renommé le paquet standard, alors que la "
"version du fork utilise encore l'ancien nom.\n"
"Rien n'a été supprimé — votre système est intact.\n"
"\n"
"Que faire : actualisez la base des paquets (Mise à jour du système) et "
"réessayez. Si le nom reste introuvable, il faut recompiler le fork à partir "
"d'une version récente : elle apportera le bon nom de paquet."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "pacman didn't finish the rollback."
msgstr "pacman n'a pas mené l'annulation à son terme."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"What pacman said:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Réponse de pacman :\n"
"%1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Not everything was rolled back. Run the rollback again: Rexon will finish "
"what is left."
msgstr ""

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"No forks are left on the system — the rollback seems to have gone through "
"after all. Log out and log back in."
msgstr ""
"Il n'y a plus de forks dans le système — l'annulation a donc finalement "
"réussi. Déconnectez-vous puis reconnectez-vous."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "No Plasma forks found — nothing to roll back."
msgstr "Aucun fork de Plasma détecté — rien à annuler."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Couldn't build the rollback command."
msgstr "Impossible de construire la commande d'annulation."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "No Plasma forks found"
msgstr "Aucun fork de Plasma détecté"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Nothing to do"
msgstr "Aucune action"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Forks removed, stock packages restored."
msgstr "Forks supprimés, paquets KDE standard rétablis."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Couldn't determine the distribution's default Plymouth theme"
msgstr ""
"Impossible de déterminer le thème Plymouth d'origine de la distribution"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Nothing to switch the boot splash with: neither plymouth-set-default-theme "
"nor update-alternatives was found"
msgstr ""
"Impossible de changer l'écran d'amorçage : ni plymouth-set-default-theme ni "
"update-alternatives n'a été trouvé"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Couldn't reset Plymouth"
msgstr "Erreur de réinitialisation de Plymouth"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Plymouth is already on the default theme “%1”"
msgstr "Plymouth utilise déjà le thème standard « %1 »"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a theme name; “%1.plymouth” is its file name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "The “%1” theme has no %1.plymouth file"
msgstr "Le thème « %1 » ne contient pas de fichier %1.plymouth"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Plymouth reset to “%1” (initramfs rebuilt; takes effect after a restart)."
msgstr ""
"Plymouth réinitialisé sur « %1 » (initramfs reconstruit, effectif après un "
"redémarrage)."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "The login screen will go back to the distribution default “%1”."
msgstr ""
"L'écran de connexion reviendra à l'apparence par défaut de la distribution — "
"« %1 »."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "The login screen will go back to the distribution default."
msgstr ""
"L'écran de connexion reviendra à l'apparence par défaut de la distribution."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Removed SDDM overrides: %1."
msgstr "Réglages SDDM tiers supprimés : %1."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"The login screen can't show WebP pictures: the WebP image module of Qt %1 "
"isn't installed (package qt%1-imageformats or similar). Pick a PNG or JPEG "
"file."
msgstr ""
"L'écran de connexion ne peut pas afficher d'images WebP : le module WebP "
"pour Qt %1 n'est pas installé (paquet qt%1-imageformats ou similaire). "
"Choisissez un fichier PNG ou JPEG."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"The login screen shows PNG, JPEG and WebP pictures only — pick another file."
msgstr ""
"L'écran de connexion n'affiche que des images PNG, JPEG et WebP — choisissez "
"un autre fichier."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "The login screen shows PNG and JPEG pictures only — pick another file."
msgstr ""
"L'écran de connexion n'affiche que des images PNG et JPEG — choisissez un "
"autre fichier."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Background: your picture"
msgstr "Arrière-plan : votre image"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Background: your picture — no preview, Rexon has no copy of it"
msgstr "Arrière-plan : votre image — pas d'aperçu, Rexon n'en a pas de copie"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Background: set outside Rexon"
msgstr "Arrière-plan : défini en dehors de Rexon"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Background: set outside Rexon — no preview, the file can't be read"
msgstr ""
"Arrière-plan : défini en dehors de Rexon — pas d'aperçu, le fichier est "
"illisible"

#. TRANSLATORS: file dialog filter; keep the patterns in parentheses as is.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Images (*.png *.jpg *.jpeg *.webp)"
msgstr "Images (*.png *.jpg *.jpeg *.webp)"

#. TRANSLATORS: file dialog filter; keep the patterns in parentheses as is.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Images (*.png *.jpg *.jpeg)"
msgstr "Images (*.png *.jpg *.jpeg)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Scaling DPI"
msgstr "Mise à l'échelle (DPI)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Screen configuration (Wayland only)"
msgstr "Disposition des écrans (Wayland uniquement)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Shows the login screen full screen without logging you out; nothing is "
"changed. To close it, log in as any user with the password “mypassword” "
"(Plasma Login Manager's test mode), or wait two minutes. Its Sleep, Restart "
"and Shut Down buttons work for real."
msgstr ""
"Affiche l'écran de connexion en plein écran sans quitter la session ; rien "
"n'est modifié. Pour le fermer, connectez-vous avec n'importe quel "
"utilisateur et le mot de passe « mypassword » (c'est le fonctionnement du "
"mode test de Plasma Login Manager), ou attendez deux minutes. Les boutons "
"« Veille », « Redémarrer » et « Éteindre » y fonctionnent pour de vrai."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Shows the login screen with this theme full screen without logging you out; "
"nothing is changed. It closes by itself after two minutes, or switch back to "
"Rexon (Alt+Tab) and click “Close Preview”."
msgstr ""
"Affiche l'écran de connexion avec ce thème en plein écran sans quitter la "
"session ; rien n'est modifié. Il se fermera de lui-même au bout de deux "
"minutes — ou revenez à Rexon (Alt+Tab) et cliquez sur « Fermer l'aperçu »."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs rust/rexon-core/src/widget_shot.rs
#: rust/rexon-gui/qml/SteamShowcaseSection.qml
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Aperçu"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
