#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Remove %1"
msgstr "Retirer %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: Result of removing packages. %1 is a package name (or several).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Removed: %1."
msgstr "Supprimé : %1."

#. TRANSLATORS: Follows "Removed: <package>." after Rexon checked the packages again.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Everything else is in order."
msgstr "Tout le reste est en ordre."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a package name (or several).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Rexon couldn't remove %1."
msgstr "Rexon n'a pas pu supprimer %1."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a package with its new version (e.g. "gdk-pixbuf2 2.44.8"),
#. %2 a package it needs, %3 the version of %2 that stays installed,
#. %4 the newer version of %2 that already exists in another repository.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"The update would install %1, but %2, which it needs, would stay at version "
"%3: the repository your system prefers doesn't have version %4 yet."
msgstr ""
"La mise à jour installerait %1, mais %2, dont il a besoin, resterait en "
"version %3 : le dépôt que votre système consulte en premier n'a pas encore "
"la version %4."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME),
#. %2 packages with versions, e.g. "qt6-base 6.12.0 with qt6-declarative 6.11.2".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "The update would install parts of %1 of different versions (%2)."
msgstr ""
"La mise à jour installerait des éléments de %1 de versions différentes (%2)."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME),
#. %2 packages with versions, e.g. "qt6-base 6.12.0 with qt6-declarative 6.11.2".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "The last update installed parts of %1 of different versions (%2)."
msgstr ""
"La dernière mise à jour a installé des éléments de %1 de versions "
"différentes (%2)."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME),
#. %2 packages with versions, e.g. "qt6-base 6.12.0 with qt6-declarative 6.11.2".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"Parts of %1 are of different versions now (%2), and the waiting update "
"brings them together."
msgstr ""
"Les éléments de %1 sont actuellement de versions différentes (%2), et la "
"mise à jour en attente les accordera."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "After a restart, the login screen may not start — only a black screen."
msgstr ""
"Après un redémarrage, l'écran de connexion risque de ne pas démarrer — il "
"n'y aura qu'un écran noir."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Programs that use it (for example, Firefox) may stop starting."
msgstr ""
"Les programmes qui l'utilisent (par exemple Firefox) risquent de ne plus "
"démarrer."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"Don't update right now. This usually passes within a few hours, when the "
"repository catches up — then the update arrives complete."
msgstr ""
"Ne faites pas la mise à jour maintenant. En général, cela se règle en "
"quelques heures, quand le dépôt a rattrapé son retard — la mise à jour "
"arrive alors complète."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"Don't restart the computer yet. The repository usually catches up within a "
"few hours: update the system again then, and everything fits together."
msgstr ""
"Ne redémarrez pas encore l'ordinateur. En général, le dépôt rattrape son "
"retard en quelques heures : mettez alors de nouveau le système à jour, et "
"tout rentrera dans l'ordre."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Update the system now, before restarting the computer."
msgstr "Mettez le système à jour maintenant, avant de redémarrer l'ordinateur."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"If you have already updated and see a black screen after a restart: press "
"Ctrl+Alt+F3, log in with your user name and password and run “sudo pacman "
"-Syu”, then “sudo reboot”."
msgstr ""
"Si vous avez déjà fait la mise à jour et voyez un écran noir après le "
"redémarrage : appuyez sur Ctrl+Alt+F3, connectez-vous avec votre nom "
"d'utilisateur et votre mot de passe, puis lancez « sudo pacman -Syu » et "
"ensuite « sudo reboot »."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "If you have already updated and programs stop starting: run “sudo pacman "
#| "-Syu” in a terminal once the repository has caught up."
msgid ""
"If you have already updated and programs stop starting: update the system "
"again once the repository has caught up."
msgstr ""
"Si vous avez déjà fait la mise à jour et que des programmes ne démarrent "
"plus : une fois que le dépôt a rattrapé son retard, lancez « sudo pacman "
"-Syu » dans un terminal."

#. TRANSLATORS: The window has a button that puts the previous package versions back.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"If there is nothing to update yet, Rexon can put the previous versions back: "
"they are still on this computer."
msgstr ""
"S'il n'y a pas encore de mise à jour, Rexon peut remettre les versions "
"précédentes : elles sont encore sur cet ordinateur."

#. TRANSLATORS: In a desktop notification; Rexon's window has a button that puts the previous versions back.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"If there is nothing to update yet, open Rexon to put the previous versions "
"back."
msgstr ""
"S'il n'y a pas encore de mise à jour, ouvrez Rexon pour remettre les "
"versions précédentes."

#. TRANSLATORS: Button. Puts back the package versions that were installed before the last update.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Put Previous Versions Back"
msgstr "Remettre les versions précédentes"

#. TRANSLATORS: Window title. %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Put Back the Previous Versions of %1?"
msgstr "Remettre les versions précédentes de %1 ?"

#. TRANSLATORS: Ends a list of packages; %1 is how many more are not shown.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "…and %1 more"
msgstr "…et %1 de plus"

#. TRANSLATORS: Before putting the previous versions of packages back. A list of packages follows.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon will replace these packages with the versions you had before the "
"update:"
msgstr ""
"Rexon va remplacer ces paquets par les versions installées avant la mise à "
"jour :"

#. TRANSLATORS: After the list of packages that Rexon puts back.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Then Rexon checks the packages again and tells you the result."
msgstr ""
"Rexon vérifiera ensuite de nouveau les paquets et vous dira le résultat."

#. TRANSLATORS: Button in the window that confirms putting previous package versions back.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgctxt "update guard rollback"
msgid "Put Back"
msgstr "Remettre"

#. TRANSLATORS: Window title while Rexon puts previous package versions back. %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, …).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Putting Back the Previous Versions of %1"
msgstr "Remise des versions précédentes de %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: Result. %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"The previous versions of %1 are back. Restarting the computer is safe again."
msgstr ""
"Les versions précédentes de %1 sont remises. Vous pouvez de nouveau "
"redémarrer l'ordinateur sans risque."

#. TRANSLATORS: Result. %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon put the previous versions of %1 back, but the packages still don't fit "
"together."
msgstr ""
"Rexon a remis les versions précédentes de %1, mais les paquets ne concordent "
"toujours pas entre eux."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Rexon couldn't put the previous versions of %1 back."
msgstr "Rexon n'a pas pu remettre les versions précédentes de %1."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a command, %2 the time limit in seconds.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/utils.rs
msgid "Command %1: timed out (%2 s)"
msgstr "Commande %1 : délai dépassé (%2 s)"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a command, %2 the system's error text.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/utils.rs
msgid "Couldn't run the command %1: %2"
msgstr "Erreur lors de l'exécution de la commande %1 : %2"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a package that exists only in the AUR (Arch User Repository).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/utils.rs
msgid "%1 (from the AUR)"
msgstr "%1 (depuis l'AUR)"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a package name; the sentence tells the user what to install.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/utils.rs
msgid "Install the “%1” package"
msgstr "Installez le paquet « %1 »"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/utils.rs
msgid "Can't play the sound: no audio player is installed"
msgstr "Impossible de lire le son : aucun lecteur audio n'est installé"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a hint like “Install the “pipewire” package”.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/utils.rs
msgid "Can't play the sound: no audio player is installed. %1"
msgstr "Impossible de lire le son : aucun lecteur audio n'est installé. %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a program name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/utils.rs
msgid "Tool %1 not found"
msgstr "Outil %1 introuvable"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a program name, %2 the other names that were tried.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/utils.rs
msgid "Tool %1 not found (tried: %2)"
msgstr "Outil %1 introuvable (essayés : %2)"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a program name, %2 a hint like “Install the “x” package”.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/utils.rs
msgid "Tool %1 not found. %2"
msgstr "Outil %1 introuvable. %2"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a program name, %2 the other names that were tried, %3 a hint like “Install the “x” package”.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/utils.rs
msgid "Tool %1 not found (tried: %2). %3"
msgstr "Outil %1 introuvable (essayés : %2). %3"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 lists the qdbus program names that were looked for.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/utils.rs
msgid ""
"Neither dbus-send nor qdbus (%1) is installed, so Rexon can't talk to the D-"
"Bus session bus. Install the dbus package (dbus-bin on Debian/Ubuntu, dbus-"
"tools on Fedora)."
msgstr ""
"Ni dbus-send ni qdbus (%1) ne sont installés : impossible de communiquer "
"avec le bus de session D-Bus. Installez le paquet dbus (dbus-bin sur Debian/"
"Ubuntu, dbus-tools sur Fedora)."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallhaven.rs
msgid ""
"Wallpapers from wallhaven.cc, safe-for-work only. The pictures belong to "
"their authors: Rexon downloads the one you pick for you and links to its "
"page on the site."
msgstr ""
"Fonds d'écran de wallhaven.cc, uniquement tous publics (SFW). Les images "
"appartiennent à leurs auteurs : Rexon télécharge pour vous celle que vous "
"choisissez et donne le lien vers sa page sur le site."

