#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_screens.rs
msgid ""
"⚠️ Vertical wallpaper: made for a screen turned upright or for a phone. On a "
"regular landscape screen it fills the width, so only the middle part of the "
"frame is visible — the top and bottom are cut off."
msgstr ""
