#: rust/rexon-core/src/waywallen_kde_plugin.rs
msgid ""
"A copy of the Plasma wallpaper plugin for waywallen in your home folder "
"(from the KDE Store or installed by hand) hides the %1 package. Rexon left "
"the copy as is. If live wallpapers do not appear, use the packaged version — "
"the copy is kept as a backup."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du greffon de fond d'écran Plasma pour waywallen dans votre "
"dossier personnel (venant du KDE Store ou installée à la main) masque le "
"paquet %1. Rexon a laissé la copie telle quelle. Si les fonds d'écran animés "
"n'apparaissent pas, utilisez la version du paquet — la copie est conservée "
"en sauvegarde."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/waywallen_kde_plugin.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon is installing the %1 package for live wallpapers. It is built from "
